<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sabvest says has 20 pct stake in Midsouth.</title>
<headline>Sabvest says has 20 pct stake in Midsouth.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sabvest Ltd said on Wednesday it had a 20 percent equity interest in Midsouth Distributors (Pty) Ltd as a result of its subscription for an equity and loan participations in Midsouth.</p>
<p>The acquisition will have no immediate effect on the earnings or net asset value of Sabvest.</p>
<p>Midsouth are distributors to the photographich industry and the sole agents for Konica, Polaroid identification and document photographic products and a distributor of Duracell products.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
